{"version":1,"content":"<p>英皇鐘錶珠寶廣東道店上周五開幕，更是香港首間勞力士旗鑑店，由於是城中盛事，吸引不少名人紅星出席捧場，現場星光熠熠。</p><p>謝霆鋒旋風式返港擔任嘉賓，並一同見證這寶貴的里程碑，引起極大哄動。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;英皇鐘錶珠寶打造</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.629969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T10:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"5b0d76a8139a5e42dadf4de9f0cddf326b955bc7bb74cfde0f6605e9a43da774","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}